  "changelog": "- Initial release with support for Cloude-Pottier (H/A/\u03b1) eigen decomposition on fully polarimetric SAR (T3: 9 bands) data.\n- Adds simplified Freeman-Durden three-component decomposition for C3 (3-band) data.\n- Provides documentation in both English and Chinese, including detailed usage instructions and input/output conventions.\n- Outputs scattering entropy, anisotropy, scattering angle, and surface/double-bounce/volume scattering powers as GeoTIFFs, plus run manifests and statistics as JSON.\n- Supports both real SAR GeoTIFF inputs and fully offline synthetic data generation.\n- Local-only processing; user data is never uploaded.",
